<title>POLAND: Polish stocks close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish stocks close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight stocks fell, five rose and eight were flat in 27-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The WIG 20 index closed at 1,652.2 points, 0.5 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining two stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.6 percent in a 15.2-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
